Auto shows each level of a shelf its own way
Open GENRES, long-press its tab, tap "Shelf style"
Choose Auto
Level 1 is this shelf, Level 2 a genre you open
Tap Level 1 to show the genres as a list
Tap Level 2 until it says Covers
Close the dialog and the editor
The genres, as a list
Open a genre: its books show as covers
A list at the top, covers inside
